# The Little Window's "Open in" menu follows Arc 1.172.1 (#331): its list is min(rows × 46, 350) tall
# and scrolls past that, follows what the search leaves, and says "No results" for a search that
# matches nothing; with a single space the button has no ⌄ and ⇧⌘O has no menu. Heights in points:
# the 46 pt header plus the list.
budget rss=700 stalls50=20
seed settings.json {"hasSeenImportPrompt": true, "toolbarDefaultMigrated": true, "defaultLinkDestination": {"littleWindow": {}}}
